join ember (normal) right [animation="Fade In"]
ember (shocked): Tomorrow's a big one. I can just feel it.
ember (sad): I'm terrified, if I'm being honest with you.
ember: I haven't let myself feel that in a long time.
[wait time="0.1"]
- I've got you. No matter what comes.
	ember: I needed that more than words can really say. (+24 Charm)
	[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"charm":24}"]
	ember: Say it again tomorrow. I might need it twice.
	- I'll say it as many times as you need.
		ember: I'm going to hold you to that. (+10 Charm)
		[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"charm":10}"]
	- You won't need it twice. You've got this.
		ember: I hope you're right. (+10 Trust)
		[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"trust":10}"]
- Then let's be terrified together.
	ember: Oddly comforting. I'll take it. (+24 Wit)
	[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"wit":24}"]
	ember: Terrified together sounds better than terrified alone, at least.
	- Everything's better together. Even the scary parts.
		ember (sad): Especially the scary parts, maybe. (Vulnerability risk)
		do GameManager.apply_vulnerability_risk(10, 0.75)
		if {last_vulnerability_success} == true:
			ember: I think I actually believe that, coming from you.
		else:
			ember (sad): I want to believe that. I'm just not there yet.
	- Then let's just get it over with.
		ember: Straight to business. I respect it. (+10 Wit)
		[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"wit":10}"]
- I trust you. And I trust us.
	ember: "Us." I really like the sound of that word. (+24 Trust)
	[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"trust":24}"]
	ember: I haven't said that word in a long time either.
	- Say it as much as you want from now on.
		ember: I might just do that. (+10 Trust)
		[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"trust":10}"]
	- Then let's give tomorrow a reason to prove it right.
		ember: Now that's the spirit. (+10 Charm)
		[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"charm":10}"]
ember: Okay. Deep breath.
ember: Let's do this. Together, whatever happens.
do GameManager.end_dialauge()